    "detailed_description": "---  <strong>Enter the First Person Survival Horror Mystery Explorer</strong>  ---<br><br><i>&quot;There are some places you should never go... even for those you love...&quot;</i><br><br>Have your sanity tested while you search for your son and find a way home. <br>- Explore an interactive environment filled with shadows and mystery<br>- Interact with doors, furniture, electronics and more<br>- Manage your character's stamina, flashlight battery and thirst<br>- Avoid the menace that hunts you at all costs<br>- Experience rich audio landscapes with original music, artwork and sound effects<br>- Crafted classic survival horror style ambience<br><br>Designed by a small development team with a passion for &quot;Slow Burn&quot; horror.<br>- All music and audio designed and produced in Austin, Texas<br>- Free demo available<br>- Soundtrack available<br>- Made in Unreal 5<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570380/extras/5701d910dee6c2e696ac016d180c7449.avif?t=1745080149\" width=456 height=304 /></span><br><br>All rights reserved<br>Copyright 2023",
